# Save Google Maps quota

Follow [GOOGLE_API_QUOTA.md](GOOGLE_API_QUOTA.md). Default: **no new Google Places / Geocoding / Autocomplete / Distance Matrix calls.**

- Address suggest: `GET /api/geocode/suggest` (OSM Photon). Never Places Autocomplete or Place Details.
- Do not geocode on keystroke, blur, or debounce. Geocode only if start/end lack lat/lng.
- Do not use `geocode_destination` for user addresses (multi-query).
- Generate/recompute: send coords when the user picked a suggestion so Geocoding is skipped.
- Directions: one batched driving **or** walking call per generate. Transit: one cached call per consecutive pair (no waypoints). Haversine instead of Distance Matrix.
- Places: catalog seed/enrich only — never itinerary generate.
- Browser key: Maps JavaScript only. Frontend must not call Nominatim public autocomplete.

If a change would add Google billable events, use OSM, cache, or stored coordinates instead.
